#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid "Parallelism in Plumed2"
msgstr "PLUMED2 の並列処理"

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid ""
"This lesson is a pratical introduction (with some exercises with code to "
"modify) to the parallel functionality of PLUMED for the developers."
msgstr "このレッスンは、開発者向けに PLUMED の並列機能を紹介する実践的な入門であり、コードを書き換える演習も含む。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:5
msgid ""
"The code is hosted "
"[here](https://github.com/Iximiel/PlumedFlagship_parallelism). You can start"
" from the [introduction](Readme.md), and then read the [serial "
"example](Readme_Serial.md) that contains the base idea of the CV."
msgstr ""
"コードは[こちら](https://github.com/Iximiel/PlumedFlagship_parallelism)にある。まず[はじめに](Readme.md)を読み、CV"
" の基本的な考え方を説明する [Serial 版の例](Readme_Serial.md)へ進むとよい。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:7
msgid ""
"You can then navigate the three cases ([openMP](Readme_OMP.md), "
"[MPI](Readme_MPI.md), [Cuda](Readme_CUDA.md)) in any order"
msgstr ""
"その後、[OpenMP](Readme_OMP.md)、[MPI](Readme_MPI.md)、[CUDA](Readme_CUDA.md) "
"の3つの例は、どの順序で読んでもよい。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:9
msgid ""
"NB: For this lesson the CV is presented with no explicit derivatives "
"calculated."
msgstr "注意：このレッスンでは、CV の微分を明示的に計算しない形で示している。"

